              "value": "I first planned to mount the IR light inside the controller case (visible on the first wiring attempt). Testing showed the PixArt sensor accepts only 940 nm IR, which my part did not emit. Without a compatible IR LED, I used a 940 nm flashlight for the proof of concept."
